      "email": "ychaikin@users.noreply.github.com",
      "message": "Release 3.1.0 - adds UUID, -dbName flag for dataset generator, compatibility with JDK 17+ (#44)\n\n* Add Support For UUID type (originally by @thanasisKirmizis) (#43)\n\n* Fix bug where the dataset generator would fail to run when executed under JDK 21 and above.\n\n* Add ability to specify just the DB name and the generator should assume the URI to be mongodb://localhost:27017/\n\n* Update instructions that get printed out when correct args are not provided.\n\n* Update web site with new version and info. Update Javadoc to latest version for website display\n"
    },
